7. Liquidity Trail
This is more than an ordinary trailing stop.
TRON computes:
Trail MA = EMA(close, MA length)
ATR = ATR(14)
Raw Bull Trail = MA - ATR × 2
Raw Bear Trail = MA + ATR × 2
Default source values:
MA length = 13
ATR length = 14
ATR multiplier = 2.0.
The system maintains a trend state and can flip bullish/bearish depending on price relative to the trail and the Alpha Gate.
Dashboard output:
Bullish 🔺 + price
or
Bearish 🔻 + price.
